1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,240
Why

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,640
is it me?

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,970
Every generation of the Mo family head

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,480
is a spare vessel.

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,960
Your father, your grandfather, and you.

6
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,420
This is the unity of Yin and Yang you obsess over.

7
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:26,720
Wooden Armor Guard,

8
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,450
protect her.

9
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,860
She is the person you care about the most.

10
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,080
Let her go.

11
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,320
Use the Bagua Plate

12
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,039
to exchange for her life.

13
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,080
Senior Brother.

14
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,440
This kind of gate has no outer lock.

15
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:34,970
You can't open it even if you break your hands.

16
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:39,360
Mo Wuhen needs time to adapt to Wenshan's body.

17
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,800
Let's go back and rest first.

18
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,729
Then we'll come back to save Su Wan.

19
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,440
Save Mo Yun first.

20
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,680
His wound is sealed.

21
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,039
Send him to Jisheng Clinic.

22
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:59,240
Four ribs are broken.

23
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,700
One pierced into the lung.

24
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,000
Fortunately, he was sent in time.

25
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,040
His life is saved.

26
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,280
Is my father still alive?

27
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,810
His body is still alive.

28
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,440
But I don't know how much consciousness is left.

29
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,440
There is an older dungeon under the imperial city.

30
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:15,360
The entrance is in the west drainage channel.

31
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,480
He wants to use Su Wan's vitality

32
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,040
to adapt to my father's body.

33
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,500
She won't last three days.

34
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,360
This is the entrance talisman.

35
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,240
My father said,

36
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,560
when I take over as the head of the family,

37
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,960
that door will be under my control.

38
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,680
It's useless now.

39
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,800
Xiaotang.

40
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,329
Let's go.

41
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,400
How is Mo Yun?

42
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,600
His life is saved.

43
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,400
I have advised Wenshan many times.

44
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,760
The Mo family regards the unity of Yin and Yang as immortality.

45
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:44,220
But how can anyone in the world live forever?

46
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:51,079
That is a secret passage opened by the Mo family in the early years.

47
00:02:51,079 --> 00:02:53,000
Mo Wuhen needs more vitality

48
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,880
to completely swallow Wenshan.

49
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:56,120
Once swallowed,

50
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,760
they can never be separated again.

51
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,420
Sister Wanwan is his trigger.

52
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,700
There is not much time.

53
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:05,480
This is the reversal formula

54
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,600
Su Wan deduced based on the Mo family's data.

55
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,120
The Su girl deduced it right.

56
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,520
The formula can reverse the fusion,

57
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,000
but it will take some time.

58
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,840
Mo Wuhen will definitely attack the caster with all his strength.

59
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,840
I'll hold him off.

60
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,920
Treat your partners' wounds first.

61
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,720
Without them,

62
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,320
you won't last until the end.

63
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,160
The Lingshu and Qianjia are stabilized.

64
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,200
We can't delay any longer.

65
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:25,160
I have distracted the people from the Imperial City Lianglu Department.

66
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,690
Let's go when you are ready.

67
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,840
When you didn't practice well as a child,

68
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,370
you would sit here and sulk.

69
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,560
The angrier you got,

70
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,440
the more you dismantled the Wooden Armor Guard's

71
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,960
Lingshu into a mess,

72
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,400
and finally you had to come to me.

73
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,400
After I was twelve,

74
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,800
I could put it back together myself.

75
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,520
I know.

76
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,840
Since then,

77
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,520
you want to carry everything yourself.

78
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,000
Master.

79
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,680
Did you ever think about the unity of Yin and Yang when you were young?

80
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,040
I did, but I couldn't achieve it.

81
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,720
And I didn't dare to experiment with human lives.

82
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,760
The greater the power,

83
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,320
the more you must know what not to touch.

84
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:51,600
I was luckier than Mo Yun.

85
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,840
I had a good master.

86
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:55,000
Mo Yun made a wooden bird when he was five.

87
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,040
It could fly three times.

88
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,440
I praised him for it.

89
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,920
But Wen Shan smashed the wooden bird on the spot.

90
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,650
The child cried for a long time.

91
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,440
I brought it.

92
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,080
Let her go first.

93
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,720
Insert the Bagua compass into the main root

94
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,240
to reverse Kan and Li.

95
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,800
I'd like to see

96
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:40,100
if you are willing to drain the life force of the entire capital

97
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,600
to save her life.

98
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,540
Don't believe him.

99
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,409
He hasn't finished the fusion yet.

100
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,720
Leave me alone.

101
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,780
You indeed haven't finished.

102
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,040
So right now,

103
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,200
you can't beat me.

104
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,120
Ah!

105
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,570
You're courting death!

106
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,600
Wen Shan hasn't been completely swallowed up.

107
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,840
His consciousness is still inside.

108
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,600
Hahaha.

109
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,640
Oh no, he's about to fuse!

110
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:53,480
Every generation's head of the Mo family is my vessel.

111
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:56,880
They thought the unity of Yin and Yang could grant immortality.

112
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:59,440
But they were just preparing a body for me.

113
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,360
You still dare to resist?

114
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:11,280
This body is already mine.

115
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:12,680
Qinghe!

116
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,020
He's afraid of the Bagua compass.

117
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:15,960
He lied to you.

118
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:19,290
The circulation of Yin and Yang can completely destroy him.

119
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:22,600
Shut up!

120
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,240
With wood as the body,

121
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,320
and Qi as the soul.

122
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:35,120
Yin and Yang complement each other.

123
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,260
Mechanisms connect with the divine.

124
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,530
The contract can be broken.

125
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,840
But my roots buried in the dragon vein are still here.

126
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,170
Dragon-Locking Spell!

127
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,680
Let her die with me!

128
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,200
He is fusing with the capital's dragon vein!
